  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 200C. Slice the olives. Coarsely chop the capers. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves. Finely grate the parmesan. Crumble 1 stock cube into a heatproof jug, add 400ml boiling water and stir to dissolve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/489249/photos/large/78511_1-faa0a6a18e9f56ceb3be1b763bad89a1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start risotto: Heat 1 tbs olive oil in a medium ovenproof saucepan (see Kitchen hack) over medium heat. Cook the garlic, stirring, for 2 mins or until fragrant. Add the rice and 1 tbs tomato paste and cook, stirring, for 1-2 mins until the grains are well coated.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/489250/photos/large/78511_2-f847fa52a4e2893adb169ad2839e1ebd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake risotto: Add the stock and tomatoes to the pan and bring to the boil. Remove the pan from the heat. Cover and bake for 20 mins or until the liquid is absorbed and the rice is tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/489251/photos/large/78511_3-cda3d968aa5f2f785c963aa40cc5bc9a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add olives and capers: Add the olives, capers, parmesan and 2 tsp sugar to the risotto and stir until melted and combined. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/489252/photos/large/78511_4-7942c56588034e522be75c41319392d8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the risotto among bowls and top with the rocket. Drizzle with 1 tbs olive oil and 1 tbs balsamic vinegar and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/489253/photos/large/78511_5-b22957a061dfbf76c9c0cd2feb3bccb7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen hack: If you don't have an ovenproof saucepan, use a regular saucepan, then transfer the risotto to an ovenproof dish or baking dish in Step 3. Cover the dish with a lid or foil before baking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/489254/photos/large/78511_6-1ffd036c6a5a01abb201651ca2837da1.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
